Rational: show (x * y) with (-7 % 2), 0 = 0 % 1
Rational: show (x * y) with (-7 % 2), (1 % 3) = (-7) % 6
Rational: show (x * y) with (-7 % 2), (-7 % 2) = 49 % 4
Rational: show (x * y) with (-7 % 2), (22 % 7) = (-11) % 1
Rational: show (negate x) with 0 = 0 % 1
Rational: show (negate x) with (1 % 3) = (-1) % 3
Rational: show (negate x) with (-7 % 2) = 7 % 2
Rational: show (negate x) with (22 % 7) = (-22) % 7
Rational: show (abs x) with 0 = 0 % 1
Rational: show (abs x) with (1 % 3) = 1 % 3
Rational: show (abs x) with (-7 % 2) = 7 % 2
Rational: show (abs x) with (22 % 7) = 22 % 7
Rational: show (signum x) with 0 = 0 % 1
Rational: show (signum x) with (1 % 3) = 1 % 1
Rational: show (signum x) with (-7 % 2) = (-1) % 1
Rational: show (signum x) with (22 % 7) = 1 % 1
Rational: show (fromInteger 300 :: T) = 300 % 1
